  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that RNA-only models with scvi_n200 encoder and transformer aggregation achieve high accuracy (0.653). This experiment tests the effect of adding image data (resnet50) to the best RNA encoder using a simple concat fusion, isolating the impact of multimodal integration. It addresses uncertainty about whether image data improves performance and validates the role of fusion methods, while building on the established RNA encoder superiority."
